---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import WorkbenchGrid from '../components/WorkbenchGrid.astro';
import WritingItem from '../components/WritingItem.astro';
import ProjectCard from '../components/ProjectCard.astro';
import DoodleIcon from '../components/DoodleIcon.astro';
import { getFeedItems } from '../content';
import { formatDate } from '../utils';

const projects = (await getCollection('projects')).sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
const featured = projects.find((project) => project.data.featured) ?? projects[0];
const otherProjects = projects.filter((project) => project.id !== featured.id);
const feed = await getFeedItems();
const posts = feed.filter((item) => item.type === '长文');
const notes = feed.filter((item) => item.type === '碎片');
const recentPosts = (await getCollection('writing', ({ data }) => !data.draft))
  .sort((a, b) => b.data.date.valueOf() - a.data.date.valueOf());
const updates = [
  ...feed.map((item) => ({ date: item.updated ?? item.date, type: item.type, title: item.title, description: item.description, url: item.url })),
  ...projects.flatMap((project) => project.data.updates.map((update) => ({ ...update, type: '项目', url: `/projects/${project.id}/` }))),
].sort((a, b) => b.date.valueOf() - a.date.valueOf()).slice(0, 7);
---
<BaseLayout>
  <div class="shell">
    <section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">一张正在使用中的工作台</span>
        <h1 id="home-title">嗨，我是九术。</h1>
        <p class="hero-intro">我喜欢把突然冒出来的“能不能做一个”，变成真正能用的东西。</p>
        <p class="hero-description">这里是我的公开工作台，放着工具、开发记录，以及一些还没完全整理好的笔记。</p>
        <div class="hero-status"><span aria-hidden="true"></span><p>最近在完善 <a href="/projects/storagescope/">StorageScope</a>，也在把这个网站改成更像自己的地方。</p></div>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="button" href="/now/">看看我在做什么 <span>↗</span></a>
          <a class="button secondary" href={posts[0].url}>读最近的文章 <span>→</span></a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-aside-note">代码在 GitHub，过程留在这里。</p>
      </div>
      <WorkbenchGrid latestPost={posts[0]} latestNote={notes[0]} />
    </section>

    <section class="home-section updates-section" aria-labelledby="updates-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">RECENTLY / 最近更新</span><h2 id="updates-title">最近，工作台上发生了这些。</h2></div>
        <a class="text-link" href="/writing/">全部写作 →</a>
      </div>
      <ol class="update-ledger">
        {updates.map((item) => <li>
          <a href={item.url}>
            <time datetime={item.date.toISOString()}>{formatDate(item.date)}</time>
            <span class:list={['update-type', { 'is-note': item.type === '碎片' }]}>{item.type}</span>
            <div><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.description}</p></div>
            <span class="ledger-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </li>)}
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="home-section making-section" aria-labelledby="making-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">ON THE DESK / 正在制作</span><h2 id="making-title">最近主要在折腾这个。</h2></div>
        <span class="status-label">{featured.data.status}</span>
      </div>
      <article class="making-paper">
        <a class="making-screenshot" href={`/projects/${featured.id}/`}>
          <img src="/images/storagescope-tree.webp" alt="StorageScope 中以层级连线展示目录关系的三维视图" width="1384" height="841" loading="lazy" />
          <span>真实应用截图 / 已隐去本机路径</span>
        </a>
        <div class="making-note">
          <DoodleIcon name="tree" size={43} />
          <h3>{featured.data.title}</h3>
          <p class="making-tagline">{featured.data.tagline}</p>
          <p>磁盘满了之后，我想知道的不只是剩余数字，而是空间究竟藏进了哪一层目录。于是做了这个 Windows 桌面工具，把扫描、结构浏览、快照差异和后续文件操作接在一起。</p>
          <p class="pencil-note">3D 树只是补充。精确操作时，普通列表仍然重要。</p>
          <div class="making-links">
            <a class="text-link" href={`/projects/${featured.id}/`}>开发复盘 →</a>
            <a class="text-link" href={featured.data.release} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">v0.1.0 发布页 ↗</a>
            <a class="text-link" href={featured.data.repo} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="home-section home-writing" aria-labelledby="writing-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">NOTES & ESSAYS / 写作</span><h2 id="writing-title">写过的东西，和还没写完的想法。</h2></div>
        <a class="text-link" href="/rss.xml">订阅 RSS ↗</a>
      </div>
      <div class="home-writing-grid">
        <div class="home-essays">
          <h3 class="column-label"><span>长文</span><span>把过程讲完整</span></h3>
          <div class="writing-list">{recentPosts.slice(0, 3).map((post) => <WritingItem post={post} compact={true} />)}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="home-notes">
          <h3 class="column-label"><span>碎片</span><span>先留下一个念头</span></h3>
          <div class="note-stack">{notes.slice(0, 5).map((note) => <a class="note-slip" href={note.url}><span>{note.title}</span><p>{note.description}</p><span class="note-slip-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link more-writing" href="/writing/">去博客翻翻全部内容 →</a>
    </section>

    <section class="home-section other-tools" aria-labelledby="tools-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">PROJECT SHELF / 项目架</span><h2 id="tools-title">工作台上的其他项目。</h2><p>解决的问题不一样，留下的过程也不一样。</p></div>
        <a class="text-link" href="/projects/">查看项目职责 →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="project-list">{otherProjects.map((project, index) => <ProjectCard project={project} index={index} compact={true} />)}</div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
